 215:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 				ENDPOINT_RWSTREAM_DeviceDisconnected = 2, /**< Device was disconnected from the host during
 216:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 				                                           *   the transfer.
