 501:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 			
 502:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 			/** Determines if the currently selected endpoint is stalled, false otherwise.
