1062:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 			 *  \return A value from the \ref Endpoint_ControlStream_RW_ErrorCodes_t enum.
1063:./LUFA/Drivers/USB/HighLevel/../LowLevel/Endpoint.h **** 			 */
